stream
BT /F1 22 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 730 Tm (A Field Guide to Local First Software) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 706 Tm (by the mymind benchmark team) Tj ET

BT /F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 660 Tm (1. Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 640 Tm (Local first means your data lives on your device and works) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (without a connection. Your library is a database and a folder) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 612 Tm (of files, not a remote account.) Tj ET

BT /F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 576 Tm (2. The Capture Rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 556 Tm (Saving must be faster than deciding where something belongs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 542 Tm (If a note takes three taps to make, people will not take notes.) Tj ET

BT /F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 506 Tm (3. The Retrieval Promise) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 486 Tm (Search is the primary organizing system. Tags and folders are) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 472 Tm (optional furniture; the index is the floor plan.) Tj ET

BT /F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 436 Tm (4. Closing) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 416 Tm (Keep it quiet, keep it local, and let the index do the work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 402 Tm (End of field guide.) Tj ET
endstream
